            "kind": "settlement",
            "summary": "A settlement of shaded yards, carriers' lodging, potteries, and leaf warehouses near irrigated cultivation. Fine imported goods pass through, but most residents earn a living from ordinary growing, carrying, repairs, and food. Old survey lines are preserved unevenly beneath later subdivisions.",
