            "kind": "settlement",
            "summary": "An inhabited waterside district with inspection paths, channels, farms, and several later sluices replacing earlier arrangements. Only part of the old scheme remains functional. Some land deliberately left open for water has acquired other uses through later decisions.",
            "visibility": "public",
            "status": "active"
